{{{{code "html"}}}}
<div class="im-studio" style="--im-studio-w: 1920; --im-studio-h: 1080">
	<div class="im-studio-shot">… the first scene …</div>
	<div class="im-studio-shot" data-cut="dot" style="--im-studio-cut-at: 3s">… the second …</div>
</div>
{{{{/code}}}}
<p><code>--im-studio-cut-for</code> (700ms) is the length; the dot and the columns take a little more by themselves. <code>--im-studio-cut-color</code> is what the dot, the flash and the curtain are made of — the accent. <code>--im-studio-x / -y</code> on the shot move where the dot opens from.</p>
